5:Your alternative interpretation partly matches the hardware: SGI’s CRIME specification lists `TLB.tex[28]` as **28 separate 64-bit registers**, followed immediately by the clip-ID registers. The packet alone does not establish that; the external specification supplies stronger evidence than sibling similarity. [CRIME specification, Table 7-2, printed page 7-8](https://ftp.netbsd.org/pub/NetBSD/misc/macallan/sgimips/crime.pdf#page=164).
