28:The loop runs at `hwi = 0, 2, 4, 6`. Its final increment does not perform another write. Thus the existing arm reaches exactly **31 distinct cells**, leaving **81 inaccessible through TEX writes**. Initialization still zeroes the whole array, so “never written” would be too broad.
